", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=grkilEFzD4QQ7kNvwGvdxuF&_nc_oc=AdrhqB1dLcnCBLTOnInqO5VsK4GdUaMFOtl9394WitDUI5eVC1OWctuyj01yiuGovhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7LJsqvmmN3IYnu2ieabwFKBmEFrQ8Y0upfbo7yoj4hCg&oe=6A008A79"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n6UpTQny67IQ7kNvwF3FE2O&_nc_oc=Adrf7bOw8ebOyxYerlrSyE-c7LQcpTSCJ22X33x-2ZrzWByVxYYoVjPkRjPqS7lIYo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_AFs-0yrfUJ-UtZwyFlaWEpuy6HnSBKfmiT5MxOR4xw&oe=6A00A14B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1O4rVHlcjl0Q7kNvwEaArm8&_nc_oc=AdpvY83hbmhEhpbbkmfNwHrZN6nX0kcceVA_l4hd6U2DU32O3s-kgs23SP09GVw0j3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xsYXmoyLrVCEuUGsC6pnqW_u2FXEn4WTgEyg5KK2egw&oe=6A009FCE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel